@startuml
title C14 历史实现 UML：文件完整性与 PDF Loader（已由 ADR-0005 升级）

allowmixing
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "src.ports.ingestion" {
  interface FileIntegrityStore {
    + compute_sha256(source_path: str): str
    + try_claim(file_hash, source_path, collection, owner, lease, force): ClaimStatus
    + mark_success(file_hash, source_path, collection, chunk_count, owner): None
    + mark_failed(file_hash, source_path, collection, error, owner): None
    + remove_record(file_hash, collection): None
    + list_processed(collection?): list
  }

  interface BaseLoader {
    + supported_extensions: tuple[str]
    + load(source_path: str, collection: str, trace?): Document
  }
}

package "src.libs.loader（C14 历史基线）" {
  class SQLiteIntegrityStore {
    + db_path: Path
    + timeout_seconds: float
    + compute_sha256(source_path: str): str
    + try_claim(...): ClaimStatus
    + mark_success(..., lease_owner): None
    + mark_failed(..., lease_owner): None
    + remove_record(...): None
    + list_processed(collection?): list
    - _initialize(): None
    - _connect(): Connection
    - _migrate_lease_columns(connection): None
    - _finish_status(..., lease_owner): None
  }

  class PdfLoader {
    + supported_extensions = (".pdf",)
    + image_root: Path
    + load(source_path: str, collection: str, trace?): Document
    - _extract_images(path, collection, file_hash): list
  }

  class "compute_sha256()" as ComputeSHA256 <<function>>
  class "_insert_image_placeholders()" as InsertPlaceholders <<function>>
}

package "src.core.types" {
  class Document {
    + id: str
    + text: str
    + metadata: dict
  }
}

package "外部依赖" {
  class MarkItDown <<library>>
  class PyMuPDF <<library>>
  database "SQLite ingestion_history" as IngestionHistoryDb
  folder "data/images/{collection}" as Images
}

FileIntegrityStore <|.. SQLiteIntegrityStore
BaseLoader <|.. PdfLoader : Protocol 结构匹配

SQLiteIntegrityStore ..> ComputeSHA256 : 委托计算
SQLiteIntegrityStore --> IngestionHistoryDb : BEGIN IMMEDIATE 领取\nowner 条件提交最终状态

PdfLoader ..> ComputeSHA256 : Document ID
PdfLoader ..> InsertPlaceholders : 文本锚点映射
PdfLoader --> MarkItDown : PDF -> Markdown
PdfLoader --> PyMuPDF : 图片 / 页码 / 坐标
PdfLoader --> Images : 写入 PNG
PdfLoader --> Document : 返回

note bottom of SQLiteIntegrityStore
  联合主键：(file_hash, collection)
  try_claim 原子返回三种 ClaimStatus
  有效租约拒绝重复领取，过期可接管
  旧 owner 不能提交新 owner 的状态
  WAL + busy_timeout 支持本地并发读写
end note

note bottom of PdfLoader
  正文转换失败：加载失败
  图片提取失败：降级为空 images
  每次图片出现都生成独立引用
  根据相邻文本锚点插入占位符
  锚点无法匹配时才降级追加到正文末尾
end note

legend bottom
  本图保留 C14 历史基线；当前分代控制见 current-04，不混入 reference-* / review-* 设计图。
endlegend

@enduml
